    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>Stores product warranty registration and coverage information for NovaHome customers. Each warranty record contains product details, serial number, purchase date, warranty start date, warranty end date and current warranty status. Agentforce uses this object to identify registered products, verify warranty coverage, determine warranty expiration dates and support warranty-related customer inquiries. Each warranty record is associated with a Loyalty Member record.</description>
